diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b08c312..8392887 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,12 +3,22 @@
 A small personal ledger. Accounts hold transactions; a JSON file stores everything;
 CSV files import transactions; reports print balances and monthly category totals.
 
+Each account has a currency (default USD). Exchange rates live in the store:
+`rate set EUR USD 1.10` means 1 EUR = 1.10 USD. Reports convert totals to a base
+currency (`--base`, default USD). If only the reverse rate is stored, its inverse
+is used. A missing rate is an error (exit 2). CSV files can have an optional
+`currency` column; it must match the account currency. Ledger files from before
+currencies load as USD.
+
 ```
 python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json account add checking
 python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json tx add checking 2026-01-05 -42.50 groceries "corner shop"
 python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json import checking statement.csv
 python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json report balances
 python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json report monthly 2026-01
+python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json account add savings --currency EUR
+python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json rate set EUR USD 1.10
+python -m ledgerlite.cli --store ledger.json report balances --base EUR
 ```
 
 Run tests: `python -m pytest`.
